### Server health (expects 200 {"status":"ok"})
GET https://browserverless.onrender.com/api/v1/health

###

### Server version (expects 200)
GET https://browserverless.onrender.com/api/v1/version

###

### Scrape a static HTML page
# Response: full HTML body + metadata headers:
#   x-browserverless-url, -title, -load-status, -memory-kb, -duration-ms
POST https://browserverless.onrender.com/api/v1/scrape
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/"
}

###

### Scrape endpoint with an unsupported scheme (expects 400)
POST https://browserverless.onrender.com/api/v1/scrape
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "file:///etc/passwd"
}

###

### Screenshot a page
# Response: PNG image (1280x720 viewport) + the same metadata headers
# as scrape (x-browserverless-url, -title, -load-status, -memory-kb, -duration-ms).
POST https://browserverless.onrender.com/api/v1/screenshot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/"
}
